9
00:56:24,000 --> 00:56:30,000
The Breadwinner is a 2017 animated drama film directed by Nora Twomey, and written
by Anita Doron and Deborah Ellis, based on the 2001 novel by Ellis.

10
01:02:40,000 --> 01:02:46,000
The film was an international co-production between
Canada, the Republic of Ireland and Luxembourg.

11
01:08:56,000 --> 01:09:02,000
The film had its world premiere at the 2017 Toronto International Film Festival on
8 September 2017 and received a limited release on 17 November.

12
01:15:12,000 --> 01:15:18,000
It received positive reviews from critics and received a nomination
for Best Animated Feature at the 90th Academy Awards.

13
01:21:28,000 --> 01:21:34,000
The film explores themes of based on novel or book, arranged
marriage, cartoon, imprisonment, afghanistan.

14
01:27:44,000 --> 01:27:50,000
The tone is emotional.
